      "text": " Soxilic Tractor."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:23.900",
      "start": "00:00:18.533",
      "text": " The Soxilic Tractor was invented by a German agricultural scientist by the name of Franz von"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:26.700",
      "start": "00:00:23.900",
      "text": " Soxilic in 1879."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:32.500",
      "start": "00:00:26.700",
      "text": " In today's demonstration, we will produce a tincture using the Soxilic Tractor, some ethanol,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:35.400",
      "start": "00:00:32.500",
      "text": " and some wild turkey tail mushrooms."
