      "end": "00:00:42.633",
      "start": "00:00:35.400",
      "text": " The materials required for today's demonstration will be 100% or 95% ethanol, an extraction"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:47.433",
      "start": "00:00:42.633",
      "text": " medium, and of course the Soxilic Tractor."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:52.600",
      "start": "00:00:47.433",
      "text": " To begin, I added 150-minute liters of an hydrous ethanol to a flat bottom flask."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:19.500",
      "start": "00:00:56.700",
      "text": " Next, I attached the Soxilic Tractor."
