    {
      "end": "00:01:44.967",
      "start": "00:01:39.267",
      "text": " Before we fill the extractor, it is essential that we process our medium."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:49.167",
      "start": "00:01:44.967",
      "text": " We are going to want a coarse chop or a fine powder."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:04.933",
      "start": "00:01:49.167",
      "text": " As the finer the material is, the higher the likelihood of it clogging the extractor."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:29.733",
      "start": "00:02:04.933",
      "text": " Once satisfied with the results, the material is then added to the Soxilic Tractor."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:45.500",
      "start": "00:02:29.733",
      "text": " Once I insert an adapter for the condenser, then I attach the condenser."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:56.567",
      "start": "00:02:45.500",
      "text": " I then fix both of the water feed lines."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:07.033",
      "start": "00:02:56.567",
      "text": " Once the water pump is turned on, then stirring and heating is turned on."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:12.967",
      "start": "00:03:07.033",
      "text": " The temperature will be dependent on which solvent you use."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:27.100",
      "start": "00:03:12.967",
      "text": " After about 15 minutes or so, the first extraction cycle was complete."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:32.367",
      "start": "00:03:27.100",
      "text": " As seen here, once the solvent level reaches a certain point, everything is very aggressively"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:35.100",
      "start": "00:03:32.367",
      "text": " drained and the whole cycle repeats."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:49.400",
      "start": "00:03:43.967",
      "text": " Now, how a Soxilic Tractor works is actually quite simple."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:56.000",
      "start": "00:03:49.400",
      "text": " As your solvent is boiling, the hot solvent will travel up the arm located on the right side."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:02.500",
      "start": "00:03:56.000",
      "text": " Go up the condenser, recondense, drop over the extraction medium, fill up the chamber,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:09.500",
      "start": "00:04:02.500",
      "text": " then the chamber drains and the whole cycle repeats."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:22.767",
      "start": "00:04:09.500",
      "text": " After about 6 hours of extraction, I then set up for a vacuum distillation."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:28.033",
      "start": "00:04:22.767",
      "text": " I chose vacuum over simple distillation because I was not sure if any of the compounds within"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:46.800",
      "start": "00:04:28.033",
      "text": " the mushrooms were temperature sensitive and I did not want to destroy any of the compounds."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:00.733",
      "start": "00:04:46.800",
      "text": " I then collected the majority of the remaining ethanol until I was left with approximately"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:04.600",
      "start": "00:05:00.733",
      "text": " 30 to 45 milliliters."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:10.400",
      "start": "00:05:04.600",
      "text": " Then I let the flask cool off."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:14.900",
      "start": "00:05:10.400",
      "text": " Then the remaining contents was transferred to an amber glass bottle and kept in the cool,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:15.633",
      "start": "00:05:14.900",
      "text": " dark place."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:48.733",
      "start": "00:05:41.367",
      "text": " If you have any suggestions for a future video, please leave them in the comments below."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:51.733",
      "start": "00:05:48.733",
      "text": " Also, please don't forget to like, subscribe and share."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:52.167",
      "start": "00:05:51.733",
      "text": " Thank you."
    }
